# LF everywhere, on every checkout. Git for Windows ships `core.autocrlf=true`, which wrote
# the templates out with CRLF: `lepton` built there embedded them so, and `zig fmt --check`
# refused the generated `main.zig` (measured 2026-10-18). Binary files are detected and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Microsoft's header, byte for byte as the package ships it (CRLF), so it matches its source.
zig/webview2/WebView2.h -text
# Compiled shaders (tools/d3d11-shaders.mjs): bytes, never line endings.
*.dxbc binary
*.spv binary
